program	lexer_unterminated_interpolation.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	Lexer error at 10:22: unterminated interpolation in string literal, opened at this `{` (write `\{` for a literal brace)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: Lexer error at 10:22: unterminated interpolation in string literal, opened at this `{` (write `\\{` for a literal brace)"
